# Title: Outlook Security Settings Updated - Registry
# ID: c3cefdf4-6703-4e1c-bad8-bf422fc5015a
# Status: test
# Level: medium
# Author: frack113
# Date: 2021-12-28
# Tags: attack.persistence, attack.t1137
# Description: Detects changes to the registry values related to outlook security settings
# Converted by: Sigma Universal SIEM/EDR CLI

(((registry.path:*\\SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Office\\* AND registry.path:*\\Outlook\\Security\\*)) AND NOT (((process.executable:C:\\Program Files\\Microsoft Office\\* OR process.executable:C:\\Program Files (x86)\\Microsoft Office\\*) AND process.executable:*\\OUTLOOK.EXE)))
